{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app makes one where it starts, from the decisions it saved, gives it to its tracker, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"updates it as the user decides:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let consent = Consent([.analytics: .granted])","let tracker = Tracker(consent: consent)","\/\/ Later, from the consent prompt:","consent.grant(.advertising)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each event is gated by its type’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event.consentCategory"},{"type":"text","text":", by the decisions made before it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Granted:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" delivered as any event is, written to the tracker’s store first if it has one.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Undecided:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" held in memory, and not written to the store, until the category is decided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Granting it delivers its held events in the order they were tracked, before any event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked after the grant; denying it drops them, reported on "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports"},{"type":"text","text":". The hold keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at most "},{"code":"heldRecordLimit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" events across every category and tracker: when it is full, its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"oldest is dropped to make room, reported as it happens (merged with the overflow reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not yet read). Held events are lost if the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends first."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Denied:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" dropped, and not collected at all, so not reported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a store recovered from an earlier run are gated again as the tracker starts, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent may have changed since. One whose category is now denied is dropped, reported and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forgotten by the store. One whose category is undecided is held outside the bound, still kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the store, so a full hold never drops it; if the app ends first, it is gated again on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next launch. One the store drops for its own byte bound while held is reported by the store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and still delivered if granted in this run, as a record a delivery has already read is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A category not given a status is undecided. Withdrawing consent is a denial: records the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker had already let through when it was granted are still delivered."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Copies share one set of decisions and one hold. A decision returns at once, from any thread:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it records the status, which "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returns from then on, and queues the decision"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each tracker given the consent, whose own worker releases or drops what it held. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker reports its own drops."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/init(_:heldRecordLimit:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/heldRecordCount"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/deny(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/grant(_:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/status(of:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/defaultHeldRecordLimit"],"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentatio